{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["verity.read","verity.feedback"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Write one structured bug, missing capability, or data quality report for private human triage. Only submit when the user requests reporting; do not include keys, passwords, transcripts or attachments. Returns a durable receipt and duplicate flag, not a promise of a fix. No code or production behavior changes automatically. Status is available with the same account at GET /api/index/v1/feedback/<id>.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"actual":{"maxLength":1200,"minLength":3,"type":"string"},"category":{"enum":["bug","missing_capability","data_quality"],"type":"string"},"expected":{"maxLength":1200,"minLength":3,"type":"string"},"observedAt":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"reproduction":{"items":{"maxLength":500,"minLength":3,"type":"string"},"maxItems":6,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"requestId":{"maxLength":96,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]+$","type":"string"},"surface":{"enum":["get_index_price","get_index_batch","list_index_assets","get_recorded_print","get_settlement_print","verify_print","/api/index/v1/price","/api/index/v1/batch","/api/index/v1/print","/api/index/v1/verity/catalog","/api/index/v1/pubkey","/api/index/v1/sample","/api/index/v1/history","/api/index/v1/metadata","/api/index/v1/research/compare","/api/index/v1/source-health","/api/index/v1/verity/price","/api/index/v1/verity/batch","/api/index/mcp"],"type":"string"},"symbol":{"maxLength":48,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._:/-]+$","type":"string"}},"required":["category","surface","expected","actual","reproduction"],"type":"object"},"name":"submit_verity_feedback","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":